--[[
  Roblox FreeCam + Center Teleport
  External executor LocalScript
  Features:
  - Free cam, character stay frozen
  - Center crosshair
  - Teleport to look-center (raycast)
  - Teleport auto exit freecam + hide crosshair
  - Mobile virtual stick move + swipe look
  - Exit freecam anytime without teleport
]]

